            "review_text": "Foodhoppers\n169 contributions\n0\nPho me\nMar 2016 • Couples\nWhat a great find. We were drawn to Pho 32 because of the amount of locals enjoying their morning breakfast here. The ladies really wanted us to enjoy our meal and we were given a quick tutorial of how to use the condiments which was sweet. \n\nBeef was so tender and the broth was very tasty. \n\nJust ask for the pho bò and enjoy.\nRead more\nWritten March 6, 2016",
