            "review_title": "Review at Pho 32",
            "review_text": "BUNYIP58\nMelbourne, Australia1234 contributions\n0\nBest Pho in Ho Chi Minh\nNov 2015 • Family\nIt was only by accident that we ended up eating here. The banh mi place we were looking for (Banh Mi Huynh Hoa) was closed (it was morning) so being hungry we thought what the heck and popped in here. Just a humble Pho joint, but this was easily the best Pho I have eaten in Ho Chi Minh. The broth had an outstanding depth of flavour to it. It looked very much like we were the first non-Vietnamese to come in for a while, but since they only do Pho the ordering was simple! You may not agree that this is the best Pho, but you still must try it. \n\nWe went again on an afternoon, but it was closed so I think they only do mornings.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 19, 2015",
